==History==
2016 
*The Goblin Hut [[Cards|card]] was added with Clash Royale's game launch on 4/1/2016 {{Balance|Add}}.
*On 29/2/2016, the [[Version History#March%202016%20Update%20(29/2/2016)|March 2016 Update]], decreased the [[Spear Goblins]]' sight range to 5.5 tiles (from 6 tiles) {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 3/5/2016, the [[Version History#May 2016 Update (3/5/2016)|May 2016 Update]], increased the {{Rarity|Rare}} card Level cap to 11 (from 10) {{Balance|Buff}}. The update also fixed the "range bug", which decreased the Spear Goblins' range to 5 tiles (from 5.5 tiles) {{Balance|Nerf}}, but their effective range is unchanged.
2017
*On 16/3/2017, a [[Version History#Maintenance%20Break%20(16/3/2017)|maintenance break]], increased the Spear Goblins' projectile speed to 500 (from 350) {{Balance|Buff}}. This was done to fix some unexpected behaviour that the Spear Goblins showed.
*On 19/4/2017, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (19/4/2017)|Balance Update]], increased the Goblin Hut's hitpoints by 5% {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 9/10/2017, the [[Version History#Epic Quests Update (9/10/2017)|Epic Quests Update]], decreased the Spear Goblins' attack time interval to 1.1 seconds (from 1.3 seconds) {{Balance|Buff}}.
2018
*On 24/1/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (24/1/2018)|Balance Update]], increased the spawn time interval to 5.05 seconds (from 4.95 seconds) {{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 25/4/2018, the [[Version History#Clan%20Wars%20Update%20(25/4/2018)|Clan Wars Update]], increased the Spear Goblins’ attack time interval to 1.2 seconds (from 1.1 seconds) {{Balance|Nerf}}. The card's description was also changed slightly. It used to read “''Building that spawns Spear Goblins. But don't look inside. You don't want to see how they are made.''” ''{{Balance|Neutral}}''.
*On 4/6/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/6/2018)|Balance Update]], 
*increased the Spear Goblins’ damage by 34% {{Balance|Buff}}, but also increased their attack time interval to 1.7 seconds (from 1.2 seconds) {{Balance|Nerf}}, increased their first attack time interval to 0.5 seconds (from 0.2 seconds) {{Balance|Nerf}}, and decreased the Goblin Hut’s lifetime to 50 seconds (from 60 seconds).
*On 5/9/2018, the [[Version History#September%202018%20Update%20(5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]], changed it so that {{Rarity|Rare}} cards start at Level 3 and end at level 13 (from 1 to 11) ''{{Balance|Neutral}}''.
*On 1/10/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (1/10/2018)|Balance Update]], decreased the Goblin Hut's spawn time interval to 4.75 seconds (from 5.05 seconds) {{Balance|Buff}}.
2019
*On 1/4/2019, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (1/4/2019)|Balance Update]], decreased the Goblin Hut's spawn time interval to 4.5 seconds (from 4.75 seconds) {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 15/4/2019, the [[Version History#April%202019%20Update%20(15/4/2019)|April 2019 Update]], changed the Goblin Hut's card image ''{{Balance|Neutral}}'' and also added two extra [[Star Points|Star Levels]] {{Balance|Add}}.
*On 26/11/2019, the [[Version History#End%20of%20November%202019%20Update%20(26/11/2019)|End of November 2019 Update]], added a card render to the Goblin Hut's card info screen {{Balance|Add}}.
2020
*On 7/4/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (7/4/2020)|Balance Update]], decreased the Goblin Hut's lifetime to 40 seconds (from 50 seconds) {{Balance|Nerf}}, but also made the Goblin Hut spawn 3 additional Spear Goblins upon death {{Balance|Add}}.
*On 5/5/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (5/5/2020)|Balance Update]], decreased the Goblin Hut's hitpoints by 35% {{Balance|Nerf}}.
2021 
*On 7/6/2021, the [[Version History#Summer%202021%20Update%20(7/6/2021)|Summer 2021 Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Goblin Hut from Goblin Stadium to Jungle Arena {{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13) {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 7/12/2021, the [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(7/12/2021)|2021 Quarter 4 Update]], decreased the Goblin Hut's hitpoints by 17% {{Balance|Nerf}}, its lifetime to 31 seconds (from 40 seconds) {{Balance|Nerf}} and its spawn time interval to 4 seconds (from 4.5 seconds) {{Balance|Buff}}.
2022 
*On 3/6/2022, a maintenance break, changed the Goblin Hut's card render ''{{Balance|Neutral}}''.
*On 26/10/2022, the [[Version History#2022%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(26/10/2022)|2022 Quarter 3 Update]], moved the Arena to unlock the Goblin Hut from Jungle Arena to Goblin Stadium {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 7/12/2022, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(7/12/2022)|Balance Update]], increased the Goblin Hut's spawn time interval to 10 seconds (from 4 seconds) {{Balance|Nerf}}, decreased its lifetime to 29 seconds (from 31 seconds) {{Balance|Nerf}}, and made it so that 3 Spear Goblins will spawn per wave (from 1) {{Balance|Buff}}.
2023
*On 4/4/2023, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(4/4/2023)|Balance Update]], increased the Spear Goblins' range to 5.5 tiles (from 5 tiles) {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 6/6/2023, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(6/6/2023)|Balance Update]], decreased the Goblin Hut's Spear Goblins spawned upon death to 1 (from 3) {{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14) {{Balance|Buff}}.
2024
*On 17/6/2024, the [[Version History#Goblin World Update (17/6/2024)|Goblin World Update]], decreased the Spear Goblins’ first attack time interval to 0.3 seconds (from 0.5 seconds) {{Balance|Buff}}. It also added the Goblin Hut to the Goblin class {{Balance|Add}}.
2025
*On 8/1/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/1/2025)|Balance Update]], increased the Spear Goblins’ first attack time interval to 0.4 seconds (from 0.3 seconds) {{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], decreased the Goblin Hut's hitpoints by 0.11% {{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 5/5/2025, the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (5/5/2025)|May 2025 Update]], decreased the Goblin Hut's cost to 4 Elixir (from 5 Elixir) {{Balance|Buff}}, increased its hitpoints by 46% {{Balance|Buff}}, increased its lifetime to 30 seconds (from 29 seconds) {{Balance|Buff}}, decreased its spawn time interval to 1.7 seconds (from 10 seconds) {{Balance|Buff}}, decreased the Spear Goblin count per wave to 1 (from 3) {{Balance|Nerf}}, and made it so that Spear Goblins would spawn when an enemy is within range instead of spawning automatically ''{{Balance|Neutral}}''. It also changed the Goblin Hut's card image ''{{Balance|Neutral}}''. Its description was also changed. Prior to the update, it used to say "''Building that spawns Spear Goblins. Don't look inside... You don't want to see how they're made.''" ''{{Balance|Neutral}}''.
*On 3/6/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/6/2025)|Balance Update]], decreased the Goblin Hut's hitpoints by 6% {{Balance|Nerf}} and increased its spawn time interval to 1.8 seconds (from 1.7 seconds) {{Balance|Nerf}}.
* On 4/8/2025, the [[Version History/2025#Pass Royale and more (4/8/2025)|August 2025 Update]] increased the Goblin Hut's spawn time interval to 1.9 seconds (from 1.8 seconds) {{Balance|Nerf}}, and decrease the spawn delay to 0.5 seconds (from 1 second) {{Balance|Buff}}. In addition, the Spear Goblins’ first attack time interval was also increased to 0.5 seconds (from 0.4 seconds) {{Balance|Nerf}}, and their range was decreased to 5 tiles (from 5.5 tiles) {{Balance|Nerf}}.
* On 6/10/2025, a Balance Update decreased the Goblin Hut's hitpoints by 4%.
* On 3/11/2025, a Balance Update increased the Goblin Hut's  Spawn Period to 2.1 seconds (from 1.9 seconds).
